---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Family Foqos">
  <main class="py-24">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <div class="animate-fade-in-up">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-text-secondary hover:text-text transition-colors mb-8">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
          </svg>
          Back to Home
        </a>

        <h1 class="heading-lg mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-text-secondary">
          <p class="body-lg text-text">
            Family Foqos is designed with privacy as a core principle. We believe your family's data belongs to you - not to us, not to advertisers, not to anyone else.
          </p>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Data Collection</h2>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-text">We collect nothing.</strong> Family Foqos does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data to our servers. We don't have servers. We don't have analytics. We don't track how you use the app.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>
              All your data - profiles, settings, focus history, and family configurations - is stored locally on your device and optionally synced through your personal iCloud account.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
              <li>Profile configurations</li>
              <li>Blocked websites and apps</li>
              <li>Focus session history</li>
              <li>Family member associations</li>
              <li>Lock codes (encrypted)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              This data is protected by your device's security and Apple's iCloud encryption. We never have access to it.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">iCloud Sync</h2>
            <p>
              Family Foqos uses iCloud to sync your family lock code across devices. Only the lock code is synced - profiles and settings stay on each individual device. The synced lock code is:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
              <li>Encrypted in transit and at rest by Apple</li>
              <li>Only accessible by devices in your iCloud Family</li>
              <li>Subject to Apple's privacy policy, not ours</li>
              <li>Never accessed or readable by Family Foqos developers</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Location Data</h2>
            <p>
              Family Foqos may request access to your device's location when you attempt to end a blocking session that has location-based restrictions enabled.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="heading-sm text-text">What we collect</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>We only check your location at the moment you try to stop a blocking session</li>
                <li>We do not continuously track or store your location history</li>
                <li>Location data is processed entirely on your device and never sent anywhere</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="heading-sm text-text">Why we need it</h3>
              <p>
                You can configure profiles to only allow stopping in certain locations (e.g., "can only stop blocking at home"). This helps you stick to your screen time goals.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="heading-sm text-text">Your control</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>Location restrictions are optional - profiles work without them</li>
                <li>You can revoke location permission in iOS Settings at any time</li>
                <li>If permission is denied, you can still use profiles but geofence rules won't work</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>
              Family Foqos does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. Everything happens on your phone, or in your iCloud account.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
              Family Foqos is designed for family use, including children. Because we don't collect any data, there is no children's data to protect - it simply doesn't leave your devices.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Open Source</h2>
            <p>
              Family Foqos is fully open source. You can audit the code yourself to verify these privacy claims:
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/mnbf9rca/family-foqos"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-iris hover:text-iris-bright transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
              </svg>
              View Source on GitHub
            </a>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="heading-md text-text">Contact</h2>
            <p>
              If you have questions about this privacy policy, please open an issue on our GitHub repository or start a discussion.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="pt-8 border-t border-elevated">
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">
              Last updated: January 2025
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
